WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.646
Open Advanced Analysis

00:00:04.646 --> 00:00:07.172
Click Add a new variable

00:00:07.172 --> 00:00:16.472
Name it, pick a type and describe it

00:00:16.472 --> 00:00:18.948
Turn on Use as goal (Boolean only)

00:00:18.948 --> 00:00:30.662
Add several at once: a Number this time

00:00:30.662 --> 00:00:33.834
Click Add

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:38.123
Give context and include tool call logs

00:00:38.123 --> 00:00:40.874
Click Test to try it on a past call

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:44.480
Pick a call from the recent call log

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:48.225
Check the result against the transcript
